---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ContactBand from "../components/ContactBand.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Approach"
	description="A caring, warm and collaborative approach to counselling. Rachel Archer is an integrative, IFS-informed counsellor in Maidstone working with anxiety, depression, grief and more."
>
	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Approach</h1>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="split">
				<div class="sticky-side">
					<div class="profile-media">
						<img
							src="/images/rachel-archer.jpg"
							alt="Rachel Archer, counsellor in Maidstone"
							width="1000"
							height="1500"
							loading="lazy"
						/>
					</div>
					<p class="media-note">
						Rachel Archer &mdash; registered member of the BACP.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="prose">
					<p class="lead">
						When deciding on a therapist, it is important you feel a connection with
						the one you choose.
					</p>
					<p>
						My approach is caring, warm and collaborative. I work with individuals
						who experience anxiety or depression from relationships, family or work
						settings, or major life transitions. I feel comfortable working with
						developmental issues; people who have suffered childhood abuse of any
						kind, or individuals who have been in any life-threatening situation.
					</p>
					<p>
						I create a safe and supportive environment in which you can talk about
						your situation without fear. I will help you address those parts of
						yourself that get in the way. Through the healing process, you can learn
						to manage stress, cultivate mindfulness, and move from being stuck or
						overwhelmed to living a more fulfilling life.
					</p>
					<p>
						I am an integrative therapist, but more recently I have developed a
						great interest in working with parts. I find this approach especially
						effective in helping people to understand themselves and the choices
						they make.
					</p>
					<p>
						I can work together with you to explore and work through old patterns or
						an unexpected crisis. I have found that by treating yourself with
						compassion rather than judgement, positive change can happen.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<ContactBand />
</BaseLayout>
